          <a href="#why-ratings-mislead" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Why Box Ratings Mislead</a>
          <a href="#ceiling-height" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Ceilings and Open Plan</a>
